# Lockfiles must never be auto-merged: git can splice two JSON versions into a
# syntactically invalid file without reporting a conflict, which breaks `npm ci`.
# With `-merge`, git reports a conflict and keeps "ours" — regenerate the lock
# with `npm install --package-lock-only` instead of resolving it by hand.
clientApp/package-lock.json -merge
backend/package-lock.json -merge
